  m_Name: Choice_QuarryWorker_Report_Truth
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.ChoiceDialogueNode
  text: Dead, then. I knew it the morning I saw that door, and it still lands like a dropped block. Facing the stones, like he was waiting on something. Go on, friend, tell me the rest.
  nextNode: {fileID: 0}
  _id: 4ab431a0ad3b2e847b2575cb2831db9d
  choices:
  - text: The door opens from the inside. He could have walked out.
